OL,3,GNEWSAHealth watchdog to be 'retained
OL,4,Aand strengthened'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent health body that
OL,7,Frepresents patients and service users
OL,8,Fwill stay open, more than a year after
OL,9,Fthe government announced plans for its
OL,10,Fabolition.
OL,12,FHealthwatch Oxfordshire had been facing
OL,13,Fclosure, alongside more than 150 other
OL,14,Fbranches of the national network.
OL,16,FBut the independent watchdog has now
OL,17,Fbeen given a reprieve, with secretary
OL,18,Fof state for health and social care
OL,19,FYvette Cooper, announcing plans to
OL,20,Fretain and strengthen the current
OL,21,Fmodel.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
