OL,3,GNEWSAHealth watchdog to be 'retained
OL,4,Aand strengthened'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Veronica Barry, executive director
OL,7,Fof Healthwatch Oxfordshire, said she
OL,8,Fwas "delighted" the organisation can
OL,9,Fcontinue its "vital work listening to
OL,10,Flocal people and amplifying their
OL,11,Fvoices".
